flowchart TD
A[Open home] --> B[Fetch discovery and watch room updates]
B --> C[Select room]
C --> D{Already member?}
D -->|Yes| F[Resume room without duplicate membership]
D -->|No| E{Private room?}
E -->|Yes| P[Enter password]
P --> V[Validate password and capacity]
E -->|No| V
V --> F
F --> G[Text chat and optional audio/video]
G --> H{Action}
H -->|Change page or receive friend call| I[Keep room membership; stop or switch media separately]
H -->|Leave room| J[Set left_at; update room presence]
H -->|Owner deletes room| K[Soft delete room; close memberships and calls]
I --> B
J --> B
K --> B
